Subject: Spss import tip, requesting advice on the use of ordinal paired data--using such data with the Wilcoxon signed rank test, displaying on a 'grouped' bar chart and transferring plots to other documents (e.g Word)
Message-ID: <6tA7LTL-Gx0.3Bsh0gO3AwAJ@deducer.groups.google.com>
